specs/
docs/
charts/
*.tgz
.DS_Store
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
# NOTE: `e2e/` is NOT excluded because `Cargo.toml`'s `[workspace] members`
# lists it; `cargo build` in the Dockerfile builder stage fails to load the
# workspace manifest if `e2e/Cargo.toml` is absent. The e2e source goes into
# the builder stage only (the final distroless image just COPYs the compiled
# binary), so there's no runtime image-size impact.
